    "sub_ename": "COMPOSITION (3)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程設計幫助學生寫出架構好及文法句型正確的、不同文體的散文。。",
    "describe_eh": "\r\nStudents will learn how to write well-organized essays of pre-determined rhetorical modes, stressing the structure common in college composition: an introduction, three or more body paragraphs, and a conclusion. They will also learn to analyze and hone their English writing skills through various classroom activities that involve mutual assistance and participation.\r\n",
